kspaces#safety--resources","content":"Inference unchanged: Jobs, OnFailure + backoff 1, Mode A vLLM util ≤ 0.82 (Mode B exclusive 0.85 / Mode C SGLang 0.95), NCCL highspeed only in relevant workloads, no Always."},"658":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-164","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#safety--resources","content":"Dev tools are intentionally lighter and restart-tolerant."},"659":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-165","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#safety--resources","content":"`manage.sh` new paths have preflight cluster checks; heavy prompts untouched."},"660":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-166","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#safety--resources","content":"After changes always validate: `bazelisk test //...`"},"661":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-167","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#safety--resources","content":"Before reboot: `./scripts/manage.sh stop-dev ; ./scripts/manage.sh stop`"},"662":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-168","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#updating--versions","content":"Pin via group\\_vars. Re-run the dev playbook to upgrade."},"663":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-169","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#updating--versions","content":"For custom UI changes: edit the Next.js app under `dashboard/`, rebuild the image, and roll the deployment."},"664":{"id":"/dev-workspaces-170","page_id":"/dev-workspaces","tags":["coder","kasm","dashboard","devcontainer","helm"],"type":"text","url":"/dev-workspaces#troubleshooting","content":"Coder workspaces stuck \"connecting\"