"glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#hardware","content":"High-speed fabric (CX-7 RoCE)"},"1219":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-32","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#hardware","content":"four RoCE twins per node"},"1220":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-33","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#hardware","content":"NCCL payload / TP all-reduce **only**"},"1221":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-34","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#3-node-qsfp-ring-mode-b-and-mode-c","content":"200 Gb/s per physical port (not NVLink, not InfiniBand switch). Triangle mesh: every pair has a direct cable."},"1222":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-35","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#3-node-qsfp-ring-mode-b-and-mode-c","content":"Port0 = cage next to the RJ-45 jack; Port1 = far cage. Wrong polarity looks half-alive and dies in NCCL. MTU 9000 on CX-7. All four CX-7 netdevs per node need IPs (six unique /24s). Confirm live names with `ibdev2netdev` before baking env."},"1223":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-36","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack","tags":["litellm","inference","nvfp4","vllm","sglang","medgemma","glm","deepseek","dgx-spark","nccl"],"type":"text","url":"/litellm-rounded-stack#3-node-qsfp-ring-mode-b-and-mode-c","content":"**Mode B / Mode C NCCL** (these Jobs only — do not copy 2-node pair vars):"},"1224":{"id":"/litellm-rounded-stack-37","page_id":"/litellm-rounded-stack"