rchitecture, models-catalog,\ntroubleshooting, reboot-safety, dgx-spark-notes, monitoring-observability, dev-workspaces,\ngitea-ci-setup — at both desktop and mobile widths, waits for hydration plus the client-side\nMermaid SVGs, and drives every animation and transition to its end state before capturing so\nbaselines are reproducible."],[6280,"THEME\\_STORAGE\\_KEY"],[7182,"themeId"],[6277,"ThemeMode"],[6027,"ThemeProvider"],[6034,"ThemeSelector"],[451,"Then install &#x2A;*Node 22+** and run `cd dashboard && npm ci`, plus `docs/setup-docs.sh` for the docs site."],[803,"Then reboot workers, then spark0. Jobs will **not** come back. Full sequence: Reboot safety · Patch and reboot."],[3995,"Theory"],[1632,"There is **no** official DeepSeek-V4.1 / V4.1-Pro checkpoint. Local DeepSeek on this lab is **V4.1-Flash only** (Mode C). Do not use `nvidia/DeepSeek-V4-Flash-NVFP4` (old 284B)."],[4115,"There is no `manage.sh sync-to-k8s` verb — sync is a dashboard action after login."],[1172,"These defaults protect SSH and the control plane on remotely managed GB10 nodes. Do not weaken them for demos."],[2041,"These principles override convenience. When in doubt, choose stability and explicit control."],[3581,"They do **not** start kimi, Mode B/C, or visual Deployments"],[3582,"They do **not** weaken `restartPolicy` or Resource Guard"],[2313,"Thin `main` + **BASH\\_SOURCE source guard** (enforced by `//tests:doc_coverage`)"],[2722,"Thin `main` + BASH\\_SOURCE source guard (see §6 skeleton)"],[2354,"Thin `main` + BASH\\_SOURCE source guard (utilities with `main()`)"],[2511,"Thin RSC composer — single `Promise.all` data load"],[5696,"Thin wrappers around scripts/lib/py/lab\\_topology.py: validate the declarative\nlab topology (ansible/inventory/lab.yaml), emit flat facts, and render the\ngenerated Ansible artifacts (hosts.ini, fabric group vars, netplan,\ncloud-init user-data). The topology file is the single source of truth —\n`manage.sh setup` (discovery wizard) rewrites it, rende